{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sektori",
    "steam_appid": 2105620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.poster.avif?t=1754747132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.webm?t=1754747132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.mp4?t=1754747132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SEKTORI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sektori is an intense, fast paced twin-stick shooter infused with hard hitting techno music. Choose your upgrades carefully and create powerful builds to take on the relentless enemies and epic bosses on a constantly evolving battlefield. Sektori is a game that requires your complete focus, a game where the high-adrenaline visuals, music, and gameplay come together to transport you into another state of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple, pure gameplay. Quick runs. Lots of challenge and replayability. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A five world campaign mode with dynamically changing levels and tons of enemy variation - including epic evolving bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternate ships and configurable upgrade decks to mold your run with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three difficulty modes suited for all players, including a &quot;Revolution&quot; campaign mode for maximal challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six alternate game modes, like Classic, Gates and Assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varied selection of challenges and medals and to reach for</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEVELOPER NOTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Sektori I wanted to create a shoot'em up where every run feels familiar, but is still completely unique. A game of skill, not memorization. The hand crafted attack waves, levels and even the bosses are combined, randomized and layered with the upgrade systems in a way that creates an interesting challenge for every run. The aesthetics of the game are very much inspired by techno music. Fast, detailed, colorful, saturated, intense, aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive in, take on the challenge as it comes and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.poster.avif?t=1754747132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.webm?t=1754747132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.mp4?t=1754747132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.poster.avif?t=1754747132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.webm?t=1754747132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.mp4?t=1754747132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SEKTORI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sektori is an intense, fast paced twin-stick shooter infused with hard hitting techno music. Choose your upgrades carefully and create powerful builds to take on the relentless enemies and epic bosses on a constantly evolving battlefield. Sektori is a game that requires your complete focus, a game where the high-adrenaline visuals, music, and gameplay come together to transport you into another state of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple, pure gameplay. Quick runs. Lots of challenge and replayability. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A five world campaign mode with dynamically changing levels and tons of enemy variation - including epic evolving bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternate ships and configurable upgrade decks to mold your run with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three difficulty modes suited for all players, including a &quot;Revolution&quot; campaign mode for maximal challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six alternate game modes, like Classic, Gates and Assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varied selection of challenges and medals and to reach for</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEVELOPER NOTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Sektori I wanted to create a shoot'em up where every run feels familiar, but is still completely unique. A game of skill, not memorization. The hand crafted attack waves, levels and even the bosses are combined, randomized and layered with the upgrade systems in a way that creates an interesting challenge for every run. The aesthetics of the game are very much inspired by techno music. Fast, detailed, colorful, saturated, intense, aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive in, take on the challenge as it comes and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.poster.avif?t=1754747132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.webm?t=1754747132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.mp4?t=1754747132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
